{
  "kind": "tool-rows",
  "record_set": "tidycal-tool-rows",
  "what_this_is": "The Workshop rows for TidyCal (tidycal.com), the booking service behind a person's booking pages. Each row is one http call to TidyCal's API, with the person's TidyCal key from the vault (tidycal-api-token) placed as a bearer header on tidycal.com only. Reads list booking types (which carry each booking page's address) and bookings; the write rows create and cancel one booking. The create and cancel rows write a real booking or cancel one: their routes are unverified until the first live call.",
  "records": [
